    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Experience the ultimate 30A beach getaway at Vitamin Sea, a spacious and stylish 3-bedroom, 3-bath retreat just minutes from the sugar-white sands of Inlet Beach and the world-renowned shores of Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach. Perfect for families, groups, or multi-family vacations, this home blends coastal comfort with endless entertainment — all within easy reach of Emerald Coast attractions and dining.<br><br>🏡 About the Home<br>Step inside this beautifully appointed beach house where an open-concept living space greets you with plush seating and a large entertainment system. A fully equipped kitchen with stainless appliances makes mealtime a breeze, and the adjacent screened-in deck is ideal for morning coffee or storing beach gear.<br><br>Upstairs, the dedicated game room is a highlight — featuring arcade favorites like Pac-Man and The Simpsons, a ping pong table, mini-bar with wine fridge, and a fun kid’s play area. Space for everyone is easy with comfortable sleeping arrangements throughout the home.<br><br>🛏️ Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 10)<br>- Master Bedroom – King bed + private bath<br>- Guest Bedroom – Queen bed<br>- Upstairs Bunk Room – Full over full<br>- Additional queen sleeper sofas for flexibility<br><br>🌴 Why Guests Love Vitamin Sea<br>- Minutes from pristine beaches and sugar-white sand<br>- Family-friendly game room and lounge areas<br>- Quiet neighborhood perfect for biking or strolling<br>- Easy access to Timpoochee Trail and coastal dune lakes like Lake Powell<br><br>📍 Prime Location near 30A Beaches & Attractions<br>Just a short walk or bike ride from 30Avenue, and minutes from iconic Rosemary Beach, Vitamin Sea puts you at the heart of the best of 30A. Enjoy popular restaurants, coffee shops, live music, boutique shopping, and family-friendly entertainment right next door, along with easy access to water sports, scenic coastal trails, and outdoor adventures. Spend your days kayaking, paddleboarding, or fishing at Camp Helen State Park, or relax on the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf of Mexico.<br><br>🌟 Book Your 30A Escape Today!<br>Whether you’re planning a family vacation, Friends’ weekend, or multi-generation retreat, Vitamin Sea at 56 Sandpine Loop delivers comfort, fun, and a true coastal lifestyle on scenic 30A Florida.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 10)<br>• Upstairs Master Bedroom: King Bed<br>• Downstairs Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed<br>• Upstairs game room: 1 Queen Sleeper Sofa<br>• Upstairs Guest Bedroom: Full over Full Bunk Bed<br>• Downstairs Living Room: 1 Queen Sleeper Sofa<br>**Please Note: ALL Top Bunks have a weight limit of 100lbs<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
